 Whoever is in the packing shed on Friday morning prints the pack list, one line per order in the order the van calls.
 
+## Prices
+
+Each line shows what the order costs from the farm's price list, and the list ends with the total for the van. Prices are per dozen: £18.50 for No.1, £15.50 for No.2 and £12.00 for No.3, worked out in whole pence.
+
+The pack list always shows list prices. Trade discounts go on the monthly invoice from the office, never on the pack list, so the driver and the customer see the same figures.
+
